      "id": "f-evolution",
      "name": "FEvolution",
      "category": "SoftsEvolution",
      "signature": "FEvolution(Properties)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Properties",
          "type": "FCollectionPropertyConstFacade&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "public :",
      "docs": "Solver can contain multiple \"Groups\". Groups do not interact with each other.\nThey may be in different spaces. They may be solved in parallel, completely independently of each other.\nThe only reason why they're in the same evolution is because they share the same solver\nsettings and step together in time.\nA Group can contain multiple \"SoftBodies\". SoftBodies can interact but have different\nconstraint rules/forces."
    },
